# raw, unprocessed brand assets supplied for this project — large source
# files already optimized/copied into src/assets, public/video and
# public/icons for the site itself. Not needed to build or run the site.
# Anchored to the repo root (leading slash) so these don't accidentally
# match same-named directories elsewhere in the tree, e.g. src/assets/logo/
# — git on macOS is case-insensitive by default (core.ignorecase=true),
# so an unanchored "Logo/" here previously also matched "logo/" anywhere.
/Abous Us:History/
/Bakery Gallery/
/Logo/
/Videos/
